(setter_touchoff_z -- zero Z on the workpiece and calibrate the setter)

(Sets work Z zero at the current position, then calls setter_cal to measure D.)
(Intended to be run with the tool at the workpiece top, in place of a plain Z)
(touch off, so that later tool changes need only setter_zero.)

(Moves the machine: setter_cal traverses to the setter and probes it.)

o<setter_touchoff_z> sub

  G10 L20 P0 Z0

  o<setter_cal> call

o<setter_touchoff_z> endsub
